The browser HD derivation and account commitment implementation is translated
from Pearl Research Labs' official reference wallet, commit
99b95ac5e77450f4deebcc23ec2d30f86a885c26:

  node/btcutil/hdkeychain/extendedkey.go (DeriveNonStandard)
  node/chaincfg/params.go (network/HD parameters)
  wallet/waddrmgr/scoped_manager.go (BIP86/PQ scopes and XMSS leaf)
  wallet/waddrmgr/xmss_keys.go (XMSS seed expansion)

