src/core/wasm/xmss.wasm compiles the unmodified official XMSS implementation
and its CC0 dependency. Source hashes and compiler provenance are recorded in
xmss/provenance.json. The Wasm module exports key generation only, not XMSS
signing. See xmss/XMSS-CC0.txt for the dependency's license.

